        <a href="/en/payment/payment-guide/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">💳 <strong>How to Pay in China</strong> — Get your payment apps ready</a>
        <a href="/en/life/common-scams/" class="block bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 hover:shadow-lg hover:border-blue-300 transition">🙏 <strong>Cultural Dos and Don'ts in China</strong> — Useful before visiting Sichuan</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
